// NFC normalization does NOT map Cyrillic \u0443 to Latin 'u'.
// So normalized value would be "S\u0443nJCE" which is NOT in TRUSTED_PROVIDERS.
// This would REJECT the attack... unless the filter also removes it.
// Character.isIdentifierIgnorable(\u0443) is FALSE.
// So the homograph attack on the VALUE is caught.
